<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Not Your Role Model</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">MC Virgins</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">Not Your Role Model</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">4DRFPJnG3dE6jMJ050c733</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>02:26.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.230" end="00:15.370" ttm:agent="v1">Touchdown California, spent another 10K for a flight, flight</p>
      <p begin="00:15.370" end="00:20.350" ttm:agent="v1">I'm that guy you're thinking of that you try to be, don't you lie to me</p>
      <p begin="00:20.350" end="00:25.720" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't answer questions unless a camera is in sight, sight</p>
      <p begin="00:25.720" end="00:30.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I am not your role model that you try to be, I know you're tired of me, yeah (ay)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.620" end="00:33.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I ain't a role model, bitch (uh), so please stop actin' like me</p>
      <p begin="00:33.680" end="00:36.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I never pay the tip, snd I don't ever ask nicely (who did you wrong?)</p>
      <p begin="00:36.490" end="00:40.000" ttm:agent="v1">I hate babies, I hate dogs, I only love money and spending it every time</p>
      <p begin="00:40.000" end="00:41.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That I see the tags pricey (ay, uh)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.730" end="00:44.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Fuck marriage, I could be single and thrivin' (what else?)</p>
      <p begin="00:44.060" end="00:46.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No 401k, 'cause I'll never need no retirement (what else?)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.660" end="00:49.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't pay my producers, I don't see no requirement (what else?)</p>
      <p begin="00:49.190" end="00:51.720" ttm:agent="v1">The first thing I think of when I been drinkin' is drivin'</p>
      <p begin="00:51.720" end="00:54.380" ttm:agent="v1">You heard the lyrics in my songs, all my right and wrongs</p>
      <p begin="00:54.380" end="00:57.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">No need to emulate nothing, you right where you belong (bitch)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.080" end="00:59.060" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause ain't shit, I got skeletons in my closet</p>
      <p begin="00:59.060" end="01:02.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I don't even write my lyrics, most of them came from Prophet (and RhymeZone)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.330" end="01:04.230" ttm:agent="v1">Super bad shit, I do it on the daily</p>
      <p begin="01:04.230" end="01:07.250" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck the virgins, I'll go rogue, and I'll get the labels to pay me, huh?</p>
      <p begin="01:07.250" end="01:09.580" ttm:agent="v1">Manipulating's my favorite way of communicating</p>
      <p begin="01:09.580" end="01:12.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Telling you the truth is just, honestly, way too complicating (uh, uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.350" end="01:17.490" ttm:agent="v1">Touchdown California, spent another 10K for a flight, flight</p>
      <p begin="01:17.490" end="01:22.280" ttm:agent="v1">I'm that guy you're thinking of that you try to be, don't you lie to me</p>
      <p begin="01:22.280" end="01:27.630" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't answer questions unless a camera is in sight, sight</p>
      <p begin="01:27.630" end="01:32.760" ttm:agent="v1">I am not your role model that you try to be, I know you're tired of me, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:32.760" end="01:35.300" ttm:agent="v1">Look at the A-lists, the people that you people made famous</p>
      <p begin="01:35.300" end="01:37.670" ttm:agent="v1">Their day-to-day is not what they're portraying to us</p>
      <p begin="01:37.670" end="01:39.980" ttm:agent="v1">Why you change your profile pic for playing us?</p>
      <p begin="01:39.980" end="01:41.910" ttm:agent="v1">You makin' fan accounts? I don't deserve the praise</p>
      <p begin="01:41.910" end="01:44.370" ttm:agent="v1">You don't understand the amount of times I've fucked up</p>
      <p begin="01:44.370" end="01:47.000" ttm:agent="v1">Hurting others, making mistakes, that's why I hide behind</p>
      <p begin="01:47.000" end="01:49.350" ttm:agent="v1">Kudge, man, I don't want to be Jake, so why would you?</p>
      <p begin="01:49.350" end="01:52.040" ttm:agent="v1">You don't know what Kudge do, I love you, but think of</p>
      <p begin="01:52.040" end="01:55.650" ttm:agent="v1">All the people you look up to, like use your logic, man, fuck a project</p>
      <p begin="01:55.650" end="01:58.270" ttm:agent="v1">I promise that they're not the one that you equated God with</p>
      <p begin="01:58.270" end="02:01.470" ttm:agent="v1">Don't try to bond with anybody that'd do anything for more follows</p>
      <p begin="02:01.470" end="02:03.840" ttm:agent="v1">Love them all you want, but they are not your role model</p>
      <p begin="02:03.840" end="02:08.870" ttm:agent="v1">Touchdown California, spent another 10K for a flight, flight</p>
      <p begin="02:08.870" end="02:13.770" ttm:agent="v1">I'm that guy you're thinking of that you try to be, don't you lie to me</p>
      <p begin="02:13.770" end="02:19.290" ttm:agent="v1">And I don't answer questions unless a camera is in sight, sight</p>
      <p begin="02:19.290" end="02:24.130" ttm:agent="v1">I am not your role model that you try to be, I know you're tired of me, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:24.130" end="02:28.130" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
